  "outlook": "Outlook for the Second Quarter Fiscal 2026: The Company expects net sales to be approximately $445.0 million to $455.0 million in the second quarter of fiscal 2026, compared to $397.9 million in the prior year, for a growth rate of 11.8% to 14.4%. Gross margin is expected to be in the range of 44.0% to 44.25% and SG&A as a percentage of net sales is expected to be in the range of 17.0% to 17.25%. 2"
